WEBVTT

00:01:29.803 --> 00:01:31.171
"Tenchi Muyo: Time and Space Adventures"

00:01:31.171 --> 00:01:33.373
"Tenchi Muyo: Time and Space Adventures"
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:01:33.373 --> 00:01:34.808
"Tenchi Muyo: Time and Space Adventures"
We now present for you
a special Tenchi Muyo event!

00:01:34.808 --> 00:01:35.876
We now present for you
a special Tenchi Muyo event!

00:01:35.876 --> 00:01:40.547
The Dimensional Cause & Effect Controller,
a great invention by Professor Washu,

00:01:40.547 --> 00:01:43.850
is a device that controls the
sequence of time and space.

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:46.420
It can change the world
in any way that you want!

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:49.423
But when the device
goes out of control, well...

00:01:49.423 --> 00:01:53.460
Tenchi and company get thrown into
and beyond their time and space

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:57.030
to wander about other chaotic worlds.

00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:02.235
We are certain you are wondering
what kind of world awaits us this time.

00:02:02.235 --> 00:02:06.137
You don't have to pay admission
until you finish watching the show!

00:02:18.051 --> 00:02:23.590
How many years have passed since
I gave up everything as a police detective

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:26.626
and left on this endless journey?

00:02:26.626 --> 00:02:30.096
I would be lying if I said I have no regrets,

00:02:30.096 --> 00:02:34.935
but I had no other choice in
order to escape from that nightmare

00:02:34.935 --> 00:02:40.840
after all hopes for promotion in my
career had been completely shattered.

00:02:43.743 --> 00:02:48.882
I wandered far and finally arrived at
this port town at the end of the world.

00:02:48.882 --> 00:02:55.253
But somehow I feel this strange town
has somehow healed my wounds.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:06.424
"Noodles"

00:03:09.169 --> 00:03:10.659
Hello!

00:03:14.875 --> 00:03:16.934
What will you have?

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:19.546
"North Country Wontons"
"North Country Miso Noodles"

00:03:19.546 --> 00:03:20.981
"North Country Sliced Pork"
"North Country Noodles"

00:03:20.981 --> 00:03:22.278
"Rice"

00:03:22.582 --> 00:03:24.150
North Country Noodles.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:27.287
All right! One North Country Noodles it is!

00:03:27.287 --> 00:03:29.523
Are you traveling alone?

00:03:29.523 --> 00:03:31.024
Well, sort of.

00:03:31.024 --> 00:03:33.360
How nice to be able to do that.

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.996
But... why in this little town?

00:03:35.996 --> 00:03:39.124
Because there is really nothing
to see around here you know.

00:03:40.066 --> 00:03:42.802
Well... maybe you have
some secret story to tell us, huh?

00:03:42.802 --> 00:03:46.039
Ayeka, now... you shouldn't be prying.

00:03:46.039 --> 00:03:47.841
Oh, it's all right.

00:03:47.841 --> 00:03:51.311
I wouldn't be surprised if you did.

00:03:51.311 --> 00:03:53.947
I would never have come to
this town, if I hadn't a story myself.

00:03:53.947 --> 00:03:55.938
What did I say, Ayeka?

00:03:57.017 --> 00:03:59.519
Hah! Here you are again!

00:03:59.519 --> 00:04:02.522
You shouldn't be loitering here like this.

00:04:02.522 --> 00:04:04.457
We have our own
tavern to open, you know!

00:04:04.457 --> 00:04:06.026
I know. I know.

00:04:06.026 --> 00:04:09.018
It's hard on you, isn't it, Sasami?

00:04:11.865 --> 00:04:13.934
Here you are! North Country Noodles!

00:04:13.934 --> 00:04:14.634
Wow!

00:04:14.634 --> 00:04:15.602
"North Country"
Wow!

00:04:15.602 --> 00:04:17.570
"North Country"

00:04:27.147 --> 00:04:28.949
Delicious!

00:04:28.949 --> 00:04:32.385
So tell me, are you planning
on staying in town for a while?

00:04:32.385 --> 00:04:35.689
I guess. It looks like a nice place... to live.

00:04:35.689 --> 00:04:38.317
Yeah, it's a very nice town.

00:04:39.292 --> 00:04:43.597
Uh... I wonder, do you think I could
get some kind of job around here?

00:04:43.597 --> 00:04:46.099
Oh, I see. So you are looking for a job?

00:04:46.099 --> 00:04:48.301
You should come work at our place!

00:04:48.301 --> 00:04:49.502
Huh?

00:04:49.502 --> 00:04:53.340
Yeah, that would be great!
We run a tavern not far from here.

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:55.475
It's a small place for local
fishermen to eat and drink in,

00:04:55.475 --> 00:04:58.745
but we certainly could use some help.

00:04:58.745 --> 00:05:00.313
That would be great!

00:05:00.313 --> 00:05:02.649
Yeah! Come on! Come work with us!

00:05:02.649 --> 00:05:05.885
Well, if it's not an
imposition, I'll be glad to.

00:05:05.885 --> 00:05:06.987
Yahoo!

00:05:06.987 --> 00:05:09.581
Well, then, would you
like to come with us now?

00:05:20.066 --> 00:05:21.568
There you go.

00:05:21.568 --> 00:05:24.337
Go on, drink it up, young man!

00:05:24.337 --> 00:05:27.329
- Go, baby, go!
- Okay.

00:05:32.045 --> 00:05:34.514
Wow!

00:05:34.514 --> 00:05:36.349
Hey, there! More <i>sake!</i>

00:05:36.349 --> 00:05:38.112
Coming!

00:05:39.285 --> 00:05:42.455
- Thanks for waiting. Here you are!
- Oh, goody! More <i>sake!</i>

00:05:42.455 --> 00:05:45.025
And I'd like some grilled
fish, too, please. Thanks.

00:05:45.025 --> 00:05:46.126
Coming right up!

00:05:46.126 --> 00:05:47.794
One order grilled fish!

00:05:47.794 --> 00:05:49.462
- Right!
- Right!

00:05:49.462 --> 00:05:51.998
How are you doing? Getting settled okay?

00:05:51.998 --> 00:05:53.700
Thank you, yes.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:56.603
I heard you used to be a police detective.

00:05:56.603 --> 00:05:58.238
Oh, were you really?

00:05:58.238 --> 00:06:00.729
You didn't know that, old man?

00:06:04.744 --> 00:06:07.113
It's a long time ago...

00:06:07.113 --> 00:06:09.081
...a long time.

00:06:11.017 --> 00:06:14.754
Well, I sure am glad to have
you here with us now, Kiyone.

00:06:14.754 --> 00:06:15.889
Thanks.

00:06:15.889 --> 00:06:19.526
Yes, but I am the sweetheart of Tenchi.

00:06:19.526 --> 00:06:22.295
Wait a minute! Who did you
say was Tenchi's sweetheart?!

00:06:22.295 --> 00:06:24.531
Me! Here! That's me!

00:06:24.531 --> 00:06:28.201
What you are is rude and
impertinent and a drunkard!

00:06:28.201 --> 00:06:29.335
Huh?

00:06:29.335 --> 00:06:32.639
How dare you say such
a thing to your customer!

00:06:32.639 --> 00:06:33.907
What kind of customer are you anyway?

00:06:33.907 --> 00:06:37.143
Pay up all your debts first,
then say what you like!

00:06:37.143 --> 00:06:38.244
Tenchi, you know what I think?

00:06:38.244 --> 00:06:42.544
I think Ayeka is envious of us, don't you?

00:06:46.019 --> 00:06:47.854
Stop it, Sis, stop it!

00:06:47.854 --> 00:06:50.223
I'll show you!

00:06:50.223 --> 00:06:52.657
Take this! How do you like that?!

00:06:52.726 --> 00:06:58.631
A fun place, with fun people!

00:06:58.631 --> 00:07:01.868
- For so many years,
my heart has been frozen.

00:07:01.868 --> 00:07:03.136
- Morning!
- For so many years,
my heart has been frozen.

00:07:03.136 --> 00:07:03.737
- Good morning!
- For so many years,
my heart has been frozen.

00:07:03.737 --> 00:07:05.171
- Good morning!
- But these people in this town
are so kind that I can feel my heart

00:07:05.171 --> 00:07:06.873
- See you later!
- But these people in this town
are so kind that I can feel my heart

00:07:06.873 --> 00:07:07.307
- Have a good one!
- But these people in this town
are so kind that I can feel my heart

00:07:07.307 --> 00:07:08.374
- Have a good one!
- Starting to thaw slowly but surely
cuddled in the warmth of their hearts.

00:07:08.374 --> 00:07:09.509
- Mornin'!
- Starting to thaw slowly but surely
cuddled in the warmth of their hearts.

00:07:09.509 --> 00:07:11.841
- Good morning!
- Starting to thaw slowly but surely
cuddled in the warmth of their hearts.

00:07:15.715 --> 00:07:18.013
Miss Kiyone!

00:07:19.552 --> 00:07:21.955
Sasami, are you back
from school already?

00:07:21.955 --> 00:07:23.356
Yeah.

00:07:23.356 --> 00:07:25.992
You've been watching the
ocean again, Miss Kiyone.

00:07:25.992 --> 00:07:26.726
Yes.

00:07:26.726 --> 00:07:28.561
You like the ocean?

00:07:28.561 --> 00:07:32.165
I've grown to like it since I came here.

00:07:32.165 --> 00:07:35.502
Well, it's about time to
go open the tavern, isn't it?

00:07:35.502 --> 00:07:37.303
Mmm.

00:07:37.303 --> 00:07:39.973
- Right. I'll work hard.
- Hurry! Hurry!

00:07:39.973 --> 00:07:45.044
Now, let's let it all hang out. Let's go all
the way with our fun, folks! Okay. Okay.

00:07:45.044 --> 00:07:48.515
- Bring us more <i>sake!</i> More! More!
- And more and more?

00:07:48.515 --> 00:07:50.950
How dare you!
You haven't paid a cent!

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:54.587
A peaceful life in a small town.

00:07:54.587 --> 00:07:57.423
I don't have to look
back to the past anymore.

00:07:57.423 --> 00:08:01.860
Yes, the nightmare
is over, never to return.

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:06.125
Ah, welcome to...

00:08:08.334 --> 00:08:09.631
Kiyone?

00:08:13.506 --> 00:08:15.809
I looked everywhere, Kiyone.

00:08:15.809 --> 00:08:17.443
Mi-Mi-Mihoshi...

00:08:17.443 --> 00:08:21.247
Someone told me they
saw you around here.

00:08:21.247 --> 00:08:24.080
When I heard that, I rushed
here as fast as I could!

00:08:26.986 --> 00:08:31.624
I've been looking for
such a long time, you know.

00:08:31.624 --> 00:08:35.528
I've been looking ever
since you disappeared, Kiyone.

00:08:35.528 --> 00:08:39.732
I missed you, Kiyone.

00:08:39.732 --> 00:08:42.969
Why did you disappear
so all of a sudden, Kiyone?

00:08:42.969 --> 00:08:46.639
Oh, I missed you so much!

00:08:46.639 --> 00:08:47.473
I have news for you!

00:08:47.473 --> 00:08:51.978
I was appointed to the top
position at Okayama Police!

00:08:51.978 --> 00:08:54.113
Let's go home now

00:08:54.113 --> 00:08:58.451
and we will fight crime
together like the good old days!

00:08:58.451 --> 00:08:59.719
Come on, Kiyone!

00:08:59.719 --> 00:09:01.487
Just a minute, please.

00:09:01.487 --> 00:09:03.823
I don't have a clue what's going on here,

00:09:03.823 --> 00:09:07.527
but I'd like you to know that Miss Kiyone
is working for us at this place now.

00:09:07.527 --> 00:09:08.261
Huh?

00:09:08.261 --> 00:09:09.395
Yes, that's right.

00:09:09.395 --> 00:09:12.131
Miss Kiyone is like a
member of our family now.

00:09:12.131 --> 00:09:14.334
Oh, really. Is that right?

00:09:14.334 --> 00:09:16.336
Uh, yes, that's right.

00:09:16.336 --> 00:09:19.572
Well, I think I'll work here
too then, together with her!

00:09:19.572 --> 00:09:23.676
That's right, because we
two are partners forever!

00:09:23.676 --> 00:09:28.636
We two are partners forever!
We two are partners forever!

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:34.153
Wait! Hey, where are you going, Kiyone?!

00:09:34.153 --> 00:09:36.055
Kiyone!

00:09:36.055 --> 00:09:40.754
Whew! It looks like an even
harder job than I expected.

00:09:45.064 --> 00:09:51.838
My peaceful life in the port town, it
turned out to be a momentary dream.

00:09:51.838 --> 00:09:56.743
When will I be released
from this nightmare...

00:09:56.743 --> 00:10:00.146
...this nightmare named Mihoshi?

00:10:00.146 --> 00:10:03.604
Cancel! There we go!

00:10:13.927 --> 00:10:16.596
Good morning, Student Committee Chairman.

00:10:16.596 --> 00:10:18.621
Oh, good morning.

00:10:19.866 --> 00:10:21.301
Huh?

00:10:21.301 --> 00:10:22.669
Tsk!

00:10:22.669 --> 00:10:26.799
How unusual for you, Miss Ryoko,
not to be late for school today.

00:10:28.474 --> 00:10:31.311
Oh, man, what a lousy way to start the day.

00:10:31.311 --> 00:10:34.303
I knew when I woke up
it was gonna be a bad one.

00:10:36.282 --> 00:10:37.784
Girls, good morning!

00:10:37.784 --> 00:10:41.117
Oh, hi! Good morning to you, Tenchi!

00:11:13.453 --> 00:11:15.216
Oh, no!

00:11:16.456 --> 00:11:18.856
I'm late! I'm late!

00:11:23.296 --> 00:11:25.821
Oh, no, wait!

00:11:26.933 --> 00:11:28.560
Well, now...

00:11:29.936 --> 00:11:31.571
Huh?

00:11:31.571 --> 00:11:33.473
Ow, that hurts!

00:11:33.473 --> 00:11:35.408
You're late again, Mihoshi!

00:11:35.408 --> 00:11:38.644
I'm sorry, Miss Kiyone.

00:11:38.644 --> 00:11:42.882
Really, Mihoshi! What kind of teacher do
you expect to be when you're late every day?!

00:11:42.882 --> 00:11:45.685
I am so exasperated! I don't
even feel like talking about it.

00:11:45.685 --> 00:11:51.424
Oh, please, don't be that way!
Don't abandon me, please, Miss Kiyone!

00:11:51.424 --> 00:11:54.627
I would have abandoned you
a long time ago if I could have!

00:11:54.627 --> 00:11:56.062
Kiyone!

00:11:56.062 --> 00:11:58.264
Oh, no, of course my class is starting.

00:11:58.264 --> 00:12:00.164
Oops! Mine, too.

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:14.180
Well, next is <i>Uji-Shui-Story Volume 4.</i>

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:17.150
In this story about
the demon at Rasho-mon,

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:23.056
the demon and a warrior create a
triangle relationship with a princess and...

00:12:23.056 --> 00:12:24.724
Uh!

00:12:24.724 --> 00:12:28.761
I shouldn't be dozing off like this, not me,
the respectable chairman of the student body

00:12:28.761 --> 00:12:32.698
who should be the role model
for every student in this school.

00:12:32.698 --> 00:12:37.403
But then, this class makes
me so demonically sleepy.

00:12:37.403 --> 00:12:38.604
Huh?

00:12:38.604 --> 00:12:40.440
How could she be awake?

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:41.674
She must be eating or something.

00:12:41.674 --> 00:12:45.278
Wooo! This is great! Mmm!

00:12:45.278 --> 00:12:47.313
What do you think you're doing, Ryoko?!

00:12:47.313 --> 00:12:50.183
Huh? Well, I'm having my early lunch.

00:12:50.183 --> 00:12:54.587
And since when, does a high
school girl's lunch include <i>sake,</i> huh?

00:12:54.587 --> 00:12:57.317
Well, since today, I guess.

00:12:59.425 --> 00:13:03.162
- Oh, get over it, will you!
- You are so disrespectful!

00:13:03.162 --> 00:13:08.534
Hey! You two girls there! Be quiet,
please, or I'll have to be angry.

00:13:08.534 --> 00:13:12.438
Go on! Say something to her, Miss Mihoshi!

00:13:12.438 --> 00:13:13.473
Miss Ryoko...

00:13:13.473 --> 00:13:15.174
You want some, too? Here.

00:13:15.174 --> 00:13:17.477
Ohh! Great. Thanks.

00:13:17.477 --> 00:13:19.145
Miss Mihoshi!

00:13:19.145 --> 00:13:20.279
Miss Ryoko!

00:13:20.279 --> 00:13:22.482
You may not drink <i>sake</i> in the class.

00:13:22.482 --> 00:13:23.382
That's right!

00:13:23.382 --> 00:13:27.887
If you want to drink <i>sake,</i> wait until you're
home and have some with your dinner...

00:13:27.887 --> 00:13:29.188
That's not right!

00:13:29.188 --> 00:13:31.891
Hey. Now no need to be so uptight, Miss.

00:13:31.891 --> 00:13:34.127
Just have a sip as a token of our friendship.

00:13:34.127 --> 00:13:37.730
Oh, okay! That's very kind of you, Ryoko.

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:40.699
Just what is wrong with you two?! Eeegh!

00:13:55.882 --> 00:13:57.907
Tenchi, catch it!

00:14:06.159 --> 00:14:11.264
Now where is it? Hmm.

00:14:11.264 --> 00:14:13.166
Oh, here it is.

00:14:13.166 --> 00:14:15.327
But how come there are two of them?

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.041
Hmm, is this a cat or what?

00:14:22.041 --> 00:14:25.478
Oh, you're hurt, aren't you, little guy?

00:14:25.478 --> 00:14:27.241
Just a second now...

00:14:29.382 --> 00:14:31.680
Well, how's that?

00:14:33.186 --> 00:14:34.453
Oh...

00:14:34.453 --> 00:14:37.286
Aah! Here you are, Ryo-Ohki!

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:43.120
I looked everywhere for you!

00:14:45.364 --> 00:14:47.600
What's with this handkerchief?

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:50.503
Oh, I see now. Did you
take care of her wound?

00:14:50.503 --> 00:14:51.370
Sort of.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.539
Thank you! I'm Sasami.

00:14:53.539 --> 00:14:55.241
Sasami. I see.

00:14:55.241 --> 00:14:57.009
My name is Tenchi.

00:14:57.009 --> 00:15:01.180
Her wound is nothing serious,
so there's no need for worry, Sasami.

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:03.205
You were lucky, Ryo-Ohki.

00:15:04.717 --> 00:15:07.386
Gotta go! Bye-bye, Sasami!

00:15:07.386 --> 00:15:08.876
Oh...

00:15:22.702 --> 00:15:26.706
Sorry, Sasami, it's
my fault. I got kind of lost.

00:15:26.706 --> 00:15:28.407
Hey! Be careful, Ryo-Ohki!

00:15:28.407 --> 00:15:30.176
We're not in the Magic Kingdom now.

00:15:30.176 --> 00:15:33.312
You shouldn't be heard talking,
or there might be trouble.

00:15:33.312 --> 00:15:38.284
I know. I know. Now, let's go
home to the Magic Kingdom.

00:15:38.284 --> 00:15:40.920
Well... I'd like to stay here for a while.

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:43.723
What?! Why's that?!

00:15:43.723 --> 00:15:45.554
I... wonder why.

00:15:58.404 --> 00:16:00.372
See you tomorrow!

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:06.946
Gee, I wonder where Tenchi is, Ryo-Ohki.

00:16:06.946 --> 00:16:09.382
Hey, Sasami, we'd better leave soon.

00:16:09.382 --> 00:16:11.684
Now where? Huh?

00:16:11.684 --> 00:16:14.186
Hey, are you listening, Sasami?

00:16:14.186 --> 00:16:16.313
Hah! There!

00:16:19.925 --> 00:16:21.294
Tenchi.

00:16:21.294 --> 00:16:23.195
Ah! Hello, Chairman.

00:16:23.195 --> 00:16:25.464
Would... you like to walk home with me?

00:16:25.464 --> 00:16:26.632
Sure I would.

00:16:26.632 --> 00:16:28.000
Wait a minute.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.302
Huh?

00:16:29.302 --> 00:16:32.004
Tenchi promised to
walk home with me today.

00:16:32.004 --> 00:16:33.606
Huh?

00:16:33.606 --> 00:16:38.344
Mmm... we promised to watch the
night lights of The Grand Bridge of Seto,

00:16:38.344 --> 00:16:41.380
and spend the night together
till morning. Remember, Tenchi?

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:43.516
Well, no, I really don't remember that.

00:16:43.516 --> 00:16:48.220
You really are a juvenile delinquent, you know!

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:50.589
Go away, you pesky person! Shoo! Shoo!

00:16:50.589 --> 00:16:53.426
Hey! Why don't <i>you</i> go away?

00:16:53.426 --> 00:16:55.328
Tenchi is mine!

00:16:55.328 --> 00:16:57.363
I will not allow it!

00:16:57.363 --> 00:16:59.888
Now stop it, girls!

00:17:02.935 --> 00:17:04.470
There they go again.

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:06.839
Cut it out, both of you! Stop right now!

00:17:06.839 --> 00:17:08.808
It's really disgraceful!

00:17:08.808 --> 00:17:13.446
I believe in obliterating the
source of the disgrace here and now.

00:17:13.446 --> 00:17:16.282
She doesn't realize she is
a disgrace, too, you know.

00:17:16.282 --> 00:17:21.721
Miss Ryoko, I can't surrender Tenchi to you.
You are the disgrace of our school.

00:17:21.721 --> 00:17:26.359
It's my duty as chairman to save
Tenchi from your juvenile delinquency!

00:17:26.359 --> 00:17:27.460
Ay-yi!

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:30.830
Hmph! It's my duty to save my Tenchi from you!

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:31.964
All right. Stop.

00:17:31.964 --> 00:17:35.768
- What do you say?!
- Now calm down, Ayeka with the dark past.

00:17:35.768 --> 00:17:37.759
What are you talking about?!

00:17:39.505 --> 00:17:42.108
Oh, no! Tenchi's in real trouble!

00:17:42.108 --> 00:17:46.312
He seems to be involved
in a fight between the girls.

00:17:46.312 --> 00:17:48.481
What shall we do, Ryo-Ohki?

00:17:48.481 --> 00:17:52.184
Sasami... transform into Pretty Sammy now!

00:17:52.184 --> 00:17:54.311
Okay, then!

00:17:55.187 --> 00:17:58.491
Jugem, jugem, gokoh-no-surikire...

00:17:58.491 --> 00:18:02.655
Sammy Davis broiler chicken!

00:18:11.237 --> 00:18:15.173
The magical girl: Pretty Sammy!

00:18:18.711 --> 00:18:21.881
Oh, my! We have a
great big audience, don't we?

00:18:21.881 --> 00:18:23.849
All the more disgraceful!

00:18:23.849 --> 00:18:25.518
Leave it all to me now!

00:18:25.518 --> 00:18:26.385
Huh?

00:18:26.385 --> 00:18:28.721
Fighting is no good at all!

00:18:28.721 --> 00:18:30.756
Be friends and cheerful, all of you!

00:18:30.756 --> 00:18:33.058
That's the first step to peace!

00:18:33.058 --> 00:18:36.262
Pretty Sammy's always with a smile!

00:18:36.262 --> 00:18:37.630
Who are you?

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:40.332
And why are you dressed like that?
Are you crazy or something?

00:18:40.332 --> 00:18:42.568
Not as crazy as you are, girl.

00:18:42.568 --> 00:18:44.203
What did you say?!

00:18:44.203 --> 00:18:48.537
Wait a second, and I'll
make you friends in no time!

00:18:50.943 --> 00:18:54.071
Pretty Archery, set up!

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:01.420
Jugem, jugem, gokoh-no-surikire.

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:03.945
Be friends, you two!

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:10.463
Miss Ryoko! Miss Ayeka!

00:19:10.463 --> 00:19:12.431
Are you all right?

00:19:12.431 --> 00:19:19.071
Oh... what is this feeling I have?
My heart is pounding.

00:19:19.071 --> 00:19:20.339
Ayeka...

00:19:20.339 --> 00:19:23.576
I'm so sorry... so sorry
that I was mean to you.

00:19:23.576 --> 00:19:26.977
Mmm. Oh, no. I'm sorry.

00:19:28.113 --> 00:19:33.385
Ayeka, I confess that I've
always been rather fond of you.

00:19:33.385 --> 00:19:37.990
Is that true, Ryoko?!

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:41.260
But you seemed to care
about no one but Tenchi.

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:45.231
I got so jealous that I had to
throw myself between you two.

00:19:45.231 --> 00:19:48.667
I can't live with myself.
Can you ever forgive me?

00:19:48.667 --> 00:19:51.070
Miss Ryoko!

00:19:51.070 --> 00:19:52.560
Ayeka!

00:19:57.409 --> 00:19:59.044
Oh, you're wonderful!

00:19:59.044 --> 00:20:02.081
Please don't let me go. Never ever.

00:20:02.081 --> 00:20:04.250
Hmm, you're a sweetheart.

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:07.753
Eeeeegh! Hold on to
your sanity, both of you!

00:20:07.753 --> 00:20:10.289
This is way too much for me!

00:20:10.289 --> 00:20:12.725
What is going on here?

00:20:12.725 --> 00:20:16.662
Ahh! So this is what they call happiness.

00:20:16.662 --> 00:20:18.564
Hold me tight!

00:20:18.564 --> 00:20:22.968
I'm not sure this is evolving into
an appropriate relationship, girls!

00:20:22.968 --> 00:20:26.972
Oh, this has to be the most disgraceful
moment in the history of this school!

00:20:26.972 --> 00:20:30.376
I'm so happy for them,
being such good friends and all.

00:20:30.376 --> 00:20:32.411
This is not good.

00:20:32.411 --> 00:20:34.580
I love you, Ayeka.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.445
I am so happy.

00:20:40.019 --> 00:20:41.987
"Tenchi Muyo: Time and Space Adventures"

00:20:41.987 --> 00:20:45.024
"Tenchi Muyo: Time and Space Adventures"
The time has come to conclude this episode,
but their wild journey will continue on!

00:20:45.024 --> 00:20:47.092
The time has come to conclude this episode,
but their wild journey will continue on!

00:20:47.092 --> 00:20:49.929
How far do these different worlds go?

00:20:49.929 --> 00:20:52.798
What will happen to our hero and heroines?!

00:20:52.798 --> 00:20:55.100
In our next episode, Tenchi Muyo:
"Time and Space Adventures Part III,"

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:57.937
you will see the raging climax!

00:20:57.937 --> 00:21:01.440
Please stay tuned and see what happens...

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.876
O respectable viewers!

00:22:58.757 --> 00:23:01.126
Our event reaches a climax
with Ryoko as a gangster

00:23:01.126 --> 00:23:03.929
and Ayeka as a millionaire's daughter.

00:23:03.929 --> 00:23:06.265
Oh, I find the casting most appropriate.

00:23:06.265 --> 00:23:08.701
Mihoshi is a housewife,
and Ayeka is an old maid.

00:23:08.701 --> 00:23:10.636
What?! Who did you say is an old maid?!

00:23:10.636 --> 00:23:13.772
What fate awaits us at
the end of this adventure?

00:23:13.772 --> 00:23:15.541
A grand finale that will move you to tears!

00:23:15.541 --> 00:23:19.211
Next episode is: "Time and
Space Adventures Part III."

00:23:19.211 --> 00:23:21.873
It's unquestionably sensational!
